v 3
d dbf2stata: Batch-convert DBF files to Stata .dta using the dbf2stata Python package
d Author: William Dormechele
d Requires Stata 16 or newer and Python 3.10 or newer configured for Stata.
d After installation, type dbf2stata to start.
d Normal workflow: install the package, then type dbf2stata.
d If the Python engine is missing, dbf2stata will tell you to run dbf2stata_setup.
d dbf2stata_setup installs the required public PyPI dependency into Stata's active Python environment.
d Python package: https://pypi.org/project/dbf2stata/
d Source: https://github.com/WilliamDormechele/dbf2stata
d Keywords: DBF; dBase; FoxPro; Stata; Python; data conversion; legacy data
d Distribution-Date: 14aug2026
f dbf2stata.ado
f dbf2stata.sthlp
f dbf2stata_setup.ado
f dbf2stata_setup.sthlp
